cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use iso20022-evidence-pack-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "iso20022-evidence-pack-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for sealed ISO 20022 audit evidence packs"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server for AI agents that compiles ISO 20022
  readiness findings, remediation diffs and simulated bank responses into
  sealed audit evidence packs: eleven tools to build, seal, verify, render
  and Ed25519-sign packs, sign with AWS KMS or Vault Transit, export to S3,
  and verify SLSA provenance and cosign signatures.
authors:
